KISIP&#xa0;strengthened security of tenure for some 10 075 people.
100000 People in informal settlements provided with access to all-season roads within 500 metres and&#xa0;provided with access to improved drainage infrastructure
50000 people had improved water resources under KISIP
8500 people&#xa0;had&#xa0;improved tenure security under KISIP
Study on constraints to delivery of serviced land completed</narrative>
